  Rule: The Yearly option shows its saving in a pill

    Scenario: Savings label on iOS
      Given the subscription options in the iOS app
      Then a 110 pt × 30 pt white pill shows the saving in Open Sans Bold 13
      And its 2 pt border and text are subscriptionTintColor, radius 13 pt
      And it is inset 10 pt on phone and 35 pt on iPad

    Scenario: Savings label on Android
      Given the Yearly option has a saving in the Android app
      Then a white pill reads "N% savings" in Roboto Bold 14sp
      And it wraps its text with 15dp / 5dp padding, a 2dp border in the buy color and radius 15dp
      And it sits 50dp from the right edge, over the top edge of the Yearly option

    Scenario: No saving on Android
      Given the Yearly option has no saving in the Android app
      Then no savings label is shown

